#==============================================================================================
#
#   backing_store_manager - Painting::BackingStoreManager: construction and GC edges
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Painting/BackingStoreManager.cpp lines 24-36
#       (BackingStoreManager::BackingStoreManager and visit_edges), taken ahead of region r50
#       (which owns BackingStoreManager.cpp) by region r28: every Navigable makes one in its
#       constructor, so a top-level traversable cannot be created without it. Region r50 ports
#       the rest of the file around these.
